                <mxCell id="4802" value="29) creamos la columna: Animal_Class&lt;div&gt;CASE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN N=0 THEN &#39;Descont/Lanzamiento&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN History_Status=&#39;Old&#39; then &#39;Mammut&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN History_Status = &#39;Short&#39; then &#39;Puppy&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN History_Status = &#39;Intermittent&#39; then &#39;Kangoroo&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN Volumen in (&#39;Small&#39;) and Volatilidad&amp;gt;= vol_threshold then &#39;Rabbit&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN Volumen in (&#39;Big&#39;) and Volatilidad&amp;gt; vol_threshold then &#39;Madbull&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;WHEN Volumen in (&#39;Small&#39;) and Volatilidad &amp;lt;= vol_threshold then &#39;Mule&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;When Volumen in (&#39;Big&#39;) and Volatilidad&amp;lt;=vol_threshold then &#39;Horse&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;else &#39;NA&#39;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1619">
                    <mxGeometry x="2580" y="3930" width="250" height="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
